    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_931 : answer(sorry) ↔ ∀ᵉ (k₁ : ℕ) (k₂ ≥ 3), k₂ ≤ k₁ →\n    { (n₁, n₂) | n₁ + k₁ ≤ n₂ ∧\n      (∏ i ∈ Finset.Icc 1 k₁, (n₁ + i)).primeFactors =\n      (∏ j ∈ Finset.Icc 1 k₂, (n₂ + j)).primeFactors }.Finite",
